<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-040" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-040-ziyue" source-id="s-nanqishu-040-ziyue-ws2272748">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-040-ziyue:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">臨賀王<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-ziyue:p001:m0003" ref="kix_r92_2ed_L">子岳</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-ziyue:p001:m0006" ref="kix_r92_2ed_L">雲嶠</persName>，世祖第十六子也。永明七年封。高宗誅世祖諸子，唯<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-ziyue:p001:m0032" ref="kix_r92_2ed_L">子岳</persName>及弟六人在後，世呼爲七王。朔望入朝，上還後宮，輙嘆息曰：「我及<rs id="c-nanqishu-040-ziyue:p001:m0065" type="unresolved">司徒</rs>諸兒子皆不長，高、武子孫日長大。」永泰元年，上疾甚，絕而復蘇。於是誅<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-ziyue:p001:m0101" ref="kix_r92_2ed_L">子岳</persName>等。延興建武中，凡三誅諸王，每一行事，高宗輙先燒香火，嗚咽涕泣，衆以此輙知其夜當相殺戮也。<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-ziyue:p001:m0148" ref="kix_r92_2ed_L">子岳</persName>死時，年十四。</p>
</text>
